{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/24a554332b0c08c6028a28c5a6aa7da5.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Palettopia</i> is the relaxing city-painting game where creativity meets harmony. There's no pressure, no timers, and no demolition necessary\u2014just the tranquil joy of creation. Discover unique, procedurally-generated islands, work with their natural landscapes, and use your palette of vibrant district colors to bring your dream utopia to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/5576663ebae1db495b2550ebf398247b.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>Create harmony for your citizens, the Palettopians, by creatively painting and arranging city districts. Each district has specific requirements, and your challenge is to balance these needs while crafting a visually stunning and harmonious island. Place all district types to unlock joyous celebrations and transform each island into a thriving paradise. Can you create a masterpiece that satisfies both the Palettopians and your own artistic vision?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/37a56a0730be0f6f4a6141c84a19c43f.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Paint Your Paradise</strong>: Design your city by painting districts to suit the needs of the Palettopians. <br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Dynamic Needs System</strong>: Strategically combine districts to meet needs and unlock growth.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Infinite Islands</strong>: Explore procedurally generated maps for endless creativity and discovery.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Varying Climates:</strong> Choose from 4 Biome environments - Arid, Temperate, Arctic or Jungle<br>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0<strong>Delightful Surprises:</strong> Discover cute critters, Landmark structures, and unique Palettopians<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Creative Flexibility</strong>: Erase and adjust your districts at any time for a stress-free experience. \u00a0<br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Photo Mode</strong>: Zoom in to capture breathtaking snapshots of your utopia. <br>\u23f3 <strong>History Timelapse</strong>: Relive your progress and watch your creation evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a19ab422e97910df7299db63e057ea1e.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span><i>Palettopia</i> is lovingly crafted by a small team of friends and family united by a passion for video games, art, and creativity. Together, we aim to share the joy and wonder of building beautiful things with others.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3004170?t=1765229852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/98576d6ed776e1c4f8635fb62e8c8213aa7e1fbf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765229852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/e2ad165bece877556d121c34a970bde83e699926/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765229852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/e2ad165bece877556d121c34a970bde83e699926/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765229852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Beta v1 Update - Super Smooth Painting</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/011ee6816df3df1c3132b469886d0e24.poster.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/011ee6816df3df1c3132b469886d0e24.webm?t=1765229852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/011ee6816df3df1c3132b469886d0e24.mp4?t=1765229852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/24a554332b0c08c6028a28c5a6aa7da5.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Palettopia</i> is the relaxing city-painting game where creativity meets harmony. There's no pressure, no timers, and no demolition necessary\u2014just the tranquil joy of creation. Discover unique, procedurally-generated islands, work with their natural landscapes, and use your palette of vibrant district colors to bring your dream utopia to life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/5576663ebae1db495b2550ebf398247b.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>Create harmony for your citizens, the Palettopians, by creatively painting and arranging city districts. Each district has specific requirements, and your challenge is to balance these needs while crafting a visually stunning and harmonious island. Place all district types to unlock joyous celebrations and transform each island into a thriving paradise. Can you create a masterpiece that satisfies both the Palettopians and your own artistic vision?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/37a56a0730be0f6f4a6141c84a19c43f.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Paint Your Paradise</strong>: Design your city by painting districts to suit the needs of the Palettopians. <br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Dynamic Needs System</strong>: Strategically combine districts to meet needs and unlock growth.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Infinite Islands</strong>: Explore procedurally generated maps for endless creativity and discovery.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Varying Climates:</strong> Choose from 4 Biome environments - Arid, Temperate, Arctic or Jungle<br>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0<strong>Delightful Surprises:</strong> Discover cute critters, Landmark structures, and unique Palettopians<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Creative Flexibility</strong>: Erase and adjust your districts at any time for a stress-free experience. \u00a0<br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Photo Mode</strong>: Zoom in to capture breathtaking snapshots of your utopia. <br>\u23f3 <strong>History Timelapse</strong>: Relive your progress and watch your creation evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a19ab422e97910df7299db63e057ea1e.avif?t=1765229852\" width=1232 height=156 /></span><i>Palettopia</i> is lovingly crafted by a small team of friends and family united by a passion for video games, art, and creativity. Together, we aim to share the joy and wonder of building beautiful things with others.</p>","developers":["Oh Wow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"C